00:45:56.750 --> 00:45:59.890
That Russians believe made them very happy.

00:46:00.760 --> 00:46:09.670
Here in this house on third, uh, what's that, um, uh, stockwerk, you know, and, uh, floor?

00:46:09.930 --> 00:46:14.930
