00:46:46.340 --> 00:46:48.150
No, not too many.

00:46:48.150 --> 00:46:49.640
Only 10,000.

00:46:49.640 --> 00:46:51.070
10,000?

00:46:51.070 --> 00:46:53.570
That means 25,000 spies spying on each other.

00:46:53.570 --> 00:46:56.550
Things must get a little, uh, a little diminished.

00:46:56.550 --> 00:47:00.000
Oh, yeah, a little there, but there's also

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:03.100
Maybe 500 who are spying for both sides.

00:47:03.740 --> 00:47:04.920
He must love.

00:47:05.330 --> 00:47:06.050
That's necessary.

