00:47:46.530 --> 00:47:49.530
In Charlottenburg, Ulmstrasse 22.

00:47:49.530 --> 00:47:50.530
Does he have a phone?

00:47:50.530 --> 00:47:51.870
No.

00:47:51.870 --> 00:47:53.870
Ulmstrasse 22? Thank you.

00:47:53.870 --> 00:48:00.000
All the Schneiders in Berlin, the Russians have got a phone.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:04.620
pinch the son of the one that's got my pants well i can always sit by a window and watch

