00:52:45.980 --> 00:52:46.420
Saverin.

00:52:46.500 --> 00:52:47.280
I know where that is.

00:52:47.320 --> 00:52:47.980
Not far from here.

00:52:48.040 --> 00:52:49.340
We can take the toilet while we're in.

00:52:49.400 --> 00:52:50.500
Then it's only a short walk.

00:52:50.990 --> 00:52:51.350
Walk?

00:52:51.950 --> 00:52:52.690
Wait a second.

00:52:53.740 --> 00:52:55.130
Get the Saverin in your shoe.

00:52:56.880 --> 00:52:58.110
It's better.

00:52:58.110 --> 00:52:58.390
It's better.

