00:57:27.970 --> 00:57:30.000
From the time German kids are so hot,

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:31.620
Why, Papa is the boss.

00:57:31.620 --> 00:57:35.220
He tells you what to say, when to shut up, what to do, what to think.

00:57:35.220 --> 00:57:39.360
Papa can be the biggest jerk in the world, but what Papa says knows.

00:57:39.360 --> 00:57:43.440
And along comes another jerk like Hitler, and he becomes the Papa for all the Papas.

00:57:43.440 --> 00:57:46.980
Yes, I've read about that father complex many a time.

00:57:46.980 --> 00:57:52.170
I doubt whether it's true, but if it is, you are certainly doing nothing to cure it.

00:57:52.170 --> 00:57:53.490
What do you mean?

00:57:53.490 --> 00:57:56.670
This stupid lug, you're treating Gerda exactly the same way.

00:57:56.670 --> 00:58:00.000
You tell her what to say, what to think.

00:58:00.510 --> 00:58:02.720
You know something? You're right.

00:58:02.720 --> 00:58:04.680
When I'm wrong, I admit it.

00:58:04.680 --> 00:58:07.530
You're absolutely right.

00:58:07.530 --> 00:58:10.530
From now on, you can disagree with me.

00:58:10.530 --> 00:58:12.530
Out loud?

00:58:12.530 --> 00:58:14.770
Sure.

00:58:14.770 --> 00:58:16.770
And you'll answer questions?

00:58:16.770 --> 00:58:18.770
Of course.

00:58:18.770 --> 00:58:21.010
Good.

00:58:21.010 --> 00:58:23.010
You know, I...

00:58:23.010 --> 00:58:25.060
I'm so mixed up.

00:58:25.060 --> 00:58:27.060
We found out in Germany what was wrong.

00:58:27.060 --> 00:58:30.000
But to find out what is wrong,

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:36.620
is not so easy. I read the Russian-German papers, the American-German papers, the German-German

00:58:36.620 --> 00:58:50.470
papers. Oh, I want to find out so much about Americans. Oh, shoot, ask me. It's democracy.

00:58:52.270 --> 00:58:59.150
Go ahead, Kowalski, tell him. It's such a stupid question, what is democracy? Democracy is democracy.

00:59:02.490 --> 00:59:03.230
What is that?

00:59:03.930 --> 00:59:05.390
Everybody in your time, please.

00:59:05.590 --> 00:59:09.690
That is the police coming to check up.

00:59:09.890 --> 00:59:12.050
Let me be the first to call you Private McConaughey.

